            ],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "k5h",
                "text": "The Rupee Fund is a FOSS United community initiative, run by volunteers. We adopt the donation-refund principles in the FOSS United ",
                "marks": []
              },
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "k5j",
                "text": "refund and transfer policy",
                "marks": ["k5i"]
              },
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "k5k",
                "text": ", as reviewed on 7 September 2026: submit claims promptly, provide transaction details, and expect each donation made in error to be reviewed on its own. The local rules below apply to this fund and take precedence where the source differs. Ticket-transfer rules do not apply. Later changes to the source do not change this policy automatically.",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          },
