              },
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "k2u",
                "text": "FOSS United privacy policy",
                "marks": ["k2t"]
              },
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "k2v",
                "text": ", dated 7 February 2024, with the local rules below. These local rules define our data use and take precedence where the source differs. We do not adopt the source’s wider uses for marketing, profiling, event tickets, or ownership transfers. Foundation roles named in the source do not become roles in The Rupee Fund through adoption. Later changes to the source do not change this policy automatically.",
